369
00:31:46,020 --> 00:31:48,020
But a lot of us are committed to the Word.

370
00:31:48,020 --> 00:31:55,020
Jill being one of many of those who are committed to being able to study and understand and interpret the text on their own.

371
00:31:55,020 --> 00:32:00,020
And not just have somebody do it for them, but to do the work themselves, to be equipped to do that.

372
00:32:00,020 --> 00:32:07,020
And the second is that we equip the saints to do the work of the ministry that God is calling them to.

373
00:32:07,020 --> 00:32:18,020
And the thing that I love, one of the things I love most about our church is I plan to, if you all don't fire me and the Lord doesn't like rip me from this place, I plan to like get old and gray here.

374
00:32:18,020 --> 00:32:24,020
