And now let me tell you, this was by the same guy who put the contract on the house the first time.

422
00:35:13,020 --> 00:35:17,020
And he came to us and he promised us that finances were in order.

423
00:35:17,020 --> 00:35:20,020
He took care of what the problem was the first time.

424
00:35:20,020 --> 00:35:23,020
And we were going to be okay this time.

425
00:35:23,020 --> 00:35:24,020
Okay.

426
00:35:24,020 --> 00:35:25,020
Sure.

427
00:35:25,020 --> 00:35:28,020
First time mistake, right?

428
00:35:28,020 --> 00:35:33,020
So anyway, just to also let you know, we had two small children at the time.

429
00:35:33,020 --> 00:35:35,020
Our girls were only three and two.

430
00:35:35,020 --> 00:35:37,020
And we had a puppy.

431
