And so as you can imagine, trying to be ready for showings and packing a house

432
00:35:42,020 --> 00:35:46,020
and trying to keep things normal for the kids was a little tough.

433
00:35:46,020 --> 00:35:56,020
So long story short, this second contract fell through.

434
00:35:56,020 --> 00:36:01,020
We looked at our realtor and we were like, look, we can't accept another offer from this guy.

435
00:36:01,020 --> 00:36:05,020
If his name comes across again with an offer, we are not accepting.

436
00:36:05,020 --> 00:36:06,020
We can't.

437
00:36:06,020 --> 00:36:07,020
We can't do this.

438
00:36:07,020 --> 00:36:08,020
We were worn out.

439
00:36:08,020 --> 00:36:09,020
We were exhausted.

440
00:36:09,020 --> 00:36:12,020
But yet we had hope that something better was going to come along.

441
00:36:12,020 --> 00:36:18,020
So finally, again, you know, making sure the house is ready.

442
00:36:18,020 --> 00:36:20,020
You have those last minute showings, right?

443
00:36:20,020 --> 00:36:22,020
We'll be there in an hour.

444
00:36:22,020 --> 00:36:25,020
Oh, let's put everything in a laundry basket and shove it in the car.

445
00:36:25,020 --> 00:36:26,020
Let's go.

446
