And so we got a contract.

447
00:36:29,020 --> 00:36:31,020
A woman placed this contract.

448
00:36:31,020 --> 00:36:34,020
We accepted that offer, placed the contract, whatever.

449
00:36:34,020 --> 00:36:35,020
And everything was moving smoothly.

450
00:36:35,020 --> 00:36:39,020
We thought this was all good.

451
00:36:39,020 --> 00:36:42,020
And we got to the day before closing.

452
00:36:42,020 --> 00:36:45,020
We have everything on the trailer.

453
00:36:45,020 --> 00:36:51,020
We have it loaded, our girls' beds, the last minute toys and food in your house.

454
00:36:51,020 --> 00:36:53,020
