461
00:37:17,020 --> 00:37:21,020
And the only thing I could keep thinking was, God, why?

462
00:37:21,020 --> 00:37:24,020
Why is this happening to us?

463
00:37:24,020 --> 00:37:25,020
What are you doing?

464
00:37:25,020 --> 00:37:31,020
The realtor kept talking.

465
00:37:31,020 --> 00:37:41,020
Come to find out, the woman that placed that contract on the house was the mother of the guy who placed the first two contracts.

466
00:37:42,020 --> 00:37:45,020
She didn't have her finances in order either.

467
00:37:45,020 --> 00:37:47,020
I was done.

468
00:37:47,020 --> 00:37:49,020
I took one look at my husband.

469
00:37:49,020 --> 00:37:51,020
I said, Aaron, I don't care.

470
00:37:51,020 --> 00:37:55,020
We are not moving back into that house.

471
00:37:55,020 --> 00:38:01,020
You know, the girls were so excited because we had plans to build a house.

472
00:38:01,020 --> 00:38:05,020
And we were going to live with my in-laws in the time period.

473
00:38:05,020 --> 00:38:08,020
And so they were super excited to be able to go and live with Granny and Papaw, right?

474
00:38:08,020 --> 00:38:14,020
There's no way I could have told them, no, sorry, that's not happening.

475
00:38:14,020 --> 00:38:16,020
We've got to move back into our house again.

476
00:38:16,020 --> 00:38:18,020
I said, we're done.

477
00:38:18,020 --> 00:38:20,020
I was so deeply distressed.

478
00:38:20,020 --> 00:38:23,020
The emotional roller coaster was more than I could take.

479
00:38:24,020 --> 00:38:29,020
That moment on my knees under the weight of all that had happened.

480
00:38:29,020 --> 00:38:31,020
Again, it was automatic.

481
00:38:31,020 --> 00:38:33,020
I didn't even think about it.

482
00:38:33,020 --> 00:38:35,020
I just went to that posture.

483
00:38:35,020 --> 00:38:44,020
I imagine many of you have had moments like that in your life when everything has come crashing down and you too have felt this.

484
00:38:45,020 --> 00:38:55,020
We're more likely to surrender and allow God to take over in these times because we have nothing left.

485
00:38:55,020 --> 00:38:59,020
So we look to the Scriptures for comfort.

486
00:38:59,020 --> 00:39:05,020
Most of the times we can look in Psalms because, again, they speak for us.

487
00:39:06,020 --> 00:39:08,020
Look at Psalm 143.

488
00:39:08,020 --> 00:39:15,020
And I believe that we see David in a very similar situation of crying out before the Lord in this Psalm.

489
00:39:15,020 --> 00:39:20,020
