He has made me sit in darkness like those long dead.

500
00:40:00,020 --> 00:40:04,020
Therefore, my spirit faints within me.

501
00:40:04,020 --> 00:40:06,020
My heart within me is appalled.

502
00:40:06,020 --> 00:40:09,020
I remember the days of old.

503
00:40:09,020 --> 00:40:13,020
I meditate on all that you have done, and I ponder the work of your hands.

504
00:40:13,020 --> 00:40:19,020
I stretch out my hands to you like my soul thirsts for you like a parched land.

505
00:40:20,020 --> 00:40:22,020
